> EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT a, count(*) FROM m GROUP BY GROUPING SETS ((a), (b)) ORDER BY 1, 2 LIMIT 5
QUERY PLAN:text
Limit
  ->  Sort
        Sort Key: a, (count(*))
        ->  MixedAggregate
              Hash Key: b
              Group Key: a
              ->  Sort
                    Sort Key: a
                    ->  Seq Scan on m
-- EXPLAIN

